# RRY (UI and interaction controls)

**RRY** = **Reuse**, **Refactor early**, **Yield one implementation**.

Before adding or changing any user-facing control (picker, modal, form block, table action, upload zone, etc.):

1. **Reuse** — Search the admin app (`admin/src/app/ui/`, `grep` for similar labels/placeholders, read `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`). If the same interaction exists twice, there must be **one** shared component or directive, not a third inline copy.
2. **Refactor early** — The **second** time the same control appears (even with small visual differences), extract the shared piece **in that same change**. Do not “match later,” “standardize in a follow-up,” or leave one-off `p-select` / dialog markup because the screen is slightly different.
3. **Yield one implementation** — One component for presentation, one loader/service for data if needed, one set of styles (component + shared panel class). Callers pass inputs; they do not reimplement row templates, filter fields, or API merge logic.

## Anti-patterns (do not do this)

- Same picker/modal pattern copy-pasted across feature folders with tweaked CSS or subtitle text.
- “I'll consolidate when the user asks” after already shipping duplicates.
- Separate visual implementations that only differ by an extra metadata line — use an **input** on the shared control instead.

## When adding a new surface

- Prefer extending an existing `app-*` component with an optional input.
- If nothing fits, add **one** new component under `admin/src/app/ui/` and wire **all** call sites to it in the same task.
- Update the relevant `.cursor/rules/` entry (e.g. combo-search-select, people picker) so the next agent finds the canonical control.

## People panel (canonical — rubber stamp)

- **Panel:** `app-people` (`admin/src/app/ui/people/people.component.ts`)
  - `mode="organization"` + `clientId` on client/org pages
  - `mode="project"` + `projectContacts` / `projectContactsChange` on projects
  - Includes: **People** title, **Add person** button (new-only modal), **Add existing person** picker, list
- **Picker control:** `app-people-select` — the **only** searchable person dropdown (label: **Add existing person**, placeholder: **Search and select…**). Used in `app-people`, Task Share, nowhere else.
- **Data:** `PeoplePickerLoader` (`admin/src/app/core/people-picker.loader.ts`)
- **New person modal:** `app-create-person-modal` (create only — no “existing person” tab)

Do not add another people side panel, `people-card`, or inline pickers on feature pages.

## Organization links panel (canonical)

- **Panel:** `app-organization-links` (`admin/src/app/ui/organization-links/organization-links.component.ts`)
- Used on the person page. Shows linked organizations (name and role), unlink, and link-to-an-organization with Role.
- Callers pass the person and handle `contactChange`. Do not copy this card onto another page.
